  <item>
    <title>Lena疗愈说：希塔疗愈的真实学习体验如何？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671748c10d2f24f289ef2dd2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671748c10d2f24f289ef2dd2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 06:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们邀请到了一位学员，听她聊聊她和Lena学习希塔疗愈的真实体验如何吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">0:01</a> 受访者：我有令人羡慕的工作，但我不开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 心理咨询很好，但无法解决我的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> 初识希塔疗愈和Lena老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">4:10</a> 生活习惯变健康，自动戒酒，少油少盐，情绪释放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">5:26</a> 直觉力增强，生活事业变得轻松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">6:20</a> 希塔疗愈是什么？θ脑电波与冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">7:33</a> 用希塔疗愈找到天赋：从没学过，但超会画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">8:44</a> 希塔让我全面认识自己，成长提升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 希塔让我心想事成，即刻显化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 希塔帮我忠于心之所向，让生命绽放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 感受奇迹，相信奇迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 《彩虹小孩》疗愈内在小孩，开启创造力、想象力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 《七界1.2》开启我与一界水晶的链接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 希塔帮我提升效率，身心舒畅，活出自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a> 和Lena老师学希塔的感受：生活会实质性变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 改善原生家庭关系，和金钱关系变好</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvN97ZW5zDf4UmwowxhOIPzXVATG.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsmvw6Ua0Ynr2gFPnoWwy0ctseUe.m4a" length="34576795" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuhi4rXzI2nbq5-IOGpTb93ENIZ3.png"/>
