  <item>
    <title>疗愈对话：疾病与潜藏的情绪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659bbee94977a26ef49f78c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659bbee94977a26ef49f78c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 12:00:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，我是Lena，这期疗愈对话我邀请到了好友兼希塔疗愈学生厉医生（DR.LEE），她是知名三甲医院主治医师，从业多年收治7万余人。希望这次关于中/西医视域下情绪与疾病的分享，能为你带来启发！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>2024年6月1日（周六）晚上<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>，我将再邀厉医生，分享她对食物疗法的经验与认知，解读饮食对疾病的管理与预防。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎你参加！地址：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/elHuydjBKbZhbCVPD32P2A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/elHuydjBKbZhbCVPD32P2A"><span>周六6/1晚「饮食与疾病预防和管理」</span></a><span> 或者 点击</span><a href="https://zoom.us/j/94285559729" data-url="https://zoom.us/j/94285559729"><span>zoom.us</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">00:12:15</a> &nbsp;厉医生结合希塔疗愈，讨论潜藏情绪对于患者的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">00:22:13</a>“安慰剂效应”（placebo effect）如何改善患者信念？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">00:27:29</a> &nbsp;未来方向：西医大数据与中医个性化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">00:37:32</a> &nbsp;Lena实例分享：潜意识信念是怎样影响健康的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">00:44:00</a> &nbsp;养生真相？从年轻时就得开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">00:46:45</a> &nbsp;健康饮食迷思：全食 vs 精加工食品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3239">00:53:59</a> &nbsp;特定时代的健康语境：“上医”之为责任</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRFghlGgeA_bOXwJUsAPrdhCvCP.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu9vNmLgZlrVDM40tynJg8luf3Jd.m4a" length="55967782" type="audio/mp4"/>
